row(15, 24, 'MATERIAL', f'THE CONGREGATION\'S ERROR — A BULL FOR A BURNT-OFFERING, ONE GOAT FOR A SIN-OFFERING. "{H(15, 24, "והיה", "אם", "מעיני", "העדה", "נעשתה", "לשגגה")}" ("and if from the eyes of the congregation it was done in error" — Lev 4:13 writes "from the eyes of the ASSEMBLY": the first delta; computed) → {A(15, 24, "ויהי", "אם", "מעיני", "כנשתא", "אתעבדת", "לשלו")}; "{H(15, 24, "פר", "בן", "בקר", "אחד", "לעלה")}" ("one young bull FOR A BURNT-OFFERING" — Lev 4:14\'s bull is FOR A SIN-OFFERING: the second delta, the parser reading the two ones the Sifrei asks about) → {A(15, 24, "תור", "בר", "תורי", "חד", "לעלתא")}; "{H(15, 24, "ומנחתו", "ונסכו", "כמשפט")}" ("with its meal-offering and its libation according to the ordinance" — the burnt-offering\'s, 111:2; the table of 15:4-11 the ordinance) → {A(15, 24, "ומנחתיה", "ונסכיה", "כדחזי")} ("as is FITTING"); "{H(15, 24, "ושעיר", "עזים", "אחד", "לחטת")}" ("and one kid of goats for a sin-offering" — "for a sin-offering" WITHOUT THE ALEPH: the Bible\'s one such spelling, at the idolatry goat; the goat itself the third delta against Leviticus 4; computed) → {A(15, 24, "וצפיר", "בר", "עזי", "חד", "לחטאתא")} ("and one kid of goats for a sin-offering"). THE DELTA IS THE LAW: the Sifrei\'s whole reading (idolatry, not the other commandments) rests on these three differences from Lev 4:13-14 — the second seat\'s delta (M-23) as the section\'s subject; THE CHATAT ENGINE\'S CALL for the compile (Lev 4\'s bull displaced).')
