row(15, 31, 'MATERIAL', f'CUT OFF, SHALL BE CUT OFF; ITS INIQUITY IS IN IT. "{H(15, 31, "כי", "דבר", "יהוה", "בזה")}" ("for he has despised the word of the LORD" — one seat) → {A(15, 31, "ארי", "על", "מימרא", "דיי", "בסר")}; "{H(15, 31, "ואת", "מצותו", "הפר")}" ("and His commandment he has broken" — one seat; "break a covenant" Lev 26:44, Isa 33:8) → {A(15, 31, "וית", "פקודוהי", "אשני")} ("His commandments he has CHANGED" — the breaking rendered as altering, plural for singular); "{H(15, 31, "הכרת", "תכרת", "הנפש", "ההוא")}" ("cut off, that soul shall be cut off" — THE DOUBLED INFINITIVE\'S ONE SEAT; computed) → {A(15, 31, "אשתצאה", "תשתצי", "אנשא", "ההיא")} (the doubling KEPT by the translation — the side of the fork R. Akiva expounds; R. Yishmael: the language of men); "{H(15, 31, "עונה", "בה")}" ("its iniquity is in it" — one seat; Ezekiel 32:27\'s "their iniquity upon their bones" the Sifrei\'s echo; computed) → {A(15, 31, "חובה", "בה")} ("its sin is in it"). The Sifrei 112:2: the despiser\'s eleven faces from the Sadducee to "not even this a-fortiori"; death does not atone for this one unless repented; not visited on sons (Exod 20:5 limited); the Samaritans refuted. THE EFFECT for the compile: karet — the sanction the data channel defines as cessation.')
